# Desktop installer checksums — v0.28.0-beta.1
#
# These files are release assets (not shipped inside this folder: 38–122 MB
# each). Download from
#   https://github.com/timetorepo/researchengine/releases/tag/v0.28.0-beta.1
# then compare:
#   sha256sum  Research.Engine_0.28.0-beta.1_x64-setup.exe
#   shasum -a 256  Research.Engine_0.28.0-beta.1_amd64.AppImage
#
# Provenance: the hashes below are what CI printed for the exact files it built
# and verified *before upload* — magic bytes, NSIS/ar/ELF signature, product
# name, size — in run 36255237632 (Windows installer job 108440647064, Linux
# bundles job 108440646903; both green). A green job is the proof: the verifier
# exits 1 on any failed check, and the published annotation is its success
# branch ("installer verified").
#
# Cross-check: the byte counts GitHub reports for the uploaded assets match the
# sizes CI hashed, so the files on the release page are the files these hashes
# describe. The binaries themselves could not be pulled back into the build
# sandbox (release-assets.githubusercontent.com is unreachable from it), so this
# is CI's reading cross-checked against the release page rather than a fresh
# local re-hash — if you want a third opinion, hash after downloading.
#
#   uploaded asset sizes, as GitHub reports them: 38118747 / 46558864 / 121534968
